    "document": "Core Rules",
    "section": "01. Core Concepts",
    "ruleNumber": "01.03",
    "order": 16,
    "anchor": "01.03",
    "summary": "One player is always the active player and the other the opposing player.\n\n- Between turns, for example as a battle round begins or ends, the player taking that round’s first turn is active.\n- During a turn, the player whose turn it is is active, but a unit’s controller becomes active from being **selected to move** until that move ends, and from being picked to shoot or fight until its attacks are resolved.",
